<Base title="Services — Outside AI"><section class="page-intro shell"><p class="eyebrow">A little help. A real difference.</p><h1>Built for the way<br/><em>you actually work.</em></h1><p class="intro">Start with one thing that could be easier. We’ll build around it.</p></section><section id="business" class="section shell service-detail"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Business solutions</p><h2>Keep your systems.<br/>Lose the busywork.</h2><p>Custom, low-cost AI tools for small and medium businesses. We work with your current software and service providers, so you can improve the way things run without starting over.</p><p>Every business works a little differently. Your solution should, too. We begin with a focused task and a clear scope, keeping costs practical and the value easy to understand.</p><a class="text-link" href="/consultation/">Let’s talk about your business →</a></div><div class="example-list"><p class="eyebrow">What we could build together</p><article><h3>Follow-ups that don’t fall through.</h3><p>Draft customer replies, flag unanswered inquiries, and prepare reminders using your existing email or customer system.</p></article><article><h3>Less copying. Less paperwork.</h3><p>Turn incoming documents into organized information, prepare reports, and reduce repetitive data entry.</p></article><article><h3>Answers from your own information.</h3><p>Help your team find procedures, product details, and internal knowledge without digging through folders.</p></article><article><h3>A smoother handoff.</h3><p>Connect routine steps between the tools you already use, with review and approval where you need them.</p></article></div></section><section id="assistants" class="section tinted"><div class="shell service-detail"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Personal AI assistants</p><h2>A helping hand.<br/>Even after hours.</h2><p>An always-on AI agent built around your priorities. For business executives, busy families, and individuals who could use help keeping up with the details.</p><p>We tailor what it can access and do. You choose the permissions and which actions need your approval, so the assistant stays within boundaries you’re comfortable with.</p><a class="text-link" href="/consultation/">Let’s talk about your day →</a></div><div class="example-list"><article><h3>For the busy executive.</h3><p>Morning briefings, meeting preparation, draft replies, and reminders about the commitments that matter.</p></article><article><h3>For the busy family.</h3><p>Help organize family schedules, meal plans, school reminders, shopping lists, and the logistics of everyday life.</p></article><article><h3>For you.</h3><p>Plan a trip, organize a project, keep track of appointments, or get a little help turning a long to-do list into a manageable day.</p></article><p class="fine">These are possible starting points. We’ll confirm what works with your systems and agree on the details before building.</p></div></div></section><section class="section shell faq"><p class="eyebrow">A few practical questions</p><h2>Good to know.</h2><details><summary>Do I need to change my software?</summary><p>Our approach is to work with what you already use. In the consultation, we’ll look at your systems and confirm what connections are possible before recommending a solution.</p></details><details><summary>What does it cost?</summary><p>Pricing depends on what you need. We focus on small, useful solutions and give you a clear scope and price before work begins. We’ll explain any ongoing AI or hosting costs, too.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to know anything about AI?</summary><p>No. Bring a task, a problem, or a routine you want to improve. We’ll explain your options in plain language and help you use what we build.</p></details><details><summary>What happens in the free consultation?</summary><p>We’ll talk through your needs, how you work today, and where AI might help. If there’s a useful fit, we’ll suggest a next step. There’s no obligation to move forward.</p></details></section></Base>
